       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it is double the maximum daily ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Ordered:** 1600 mg four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Usual maximum for adults:** 800 mg per dose and 3,200 mg/day. That is the ceiling for prescription use in inflammatory conditions. Analgesic use is typically 400\u2013800 mg every 6\u20138 hours, with a maximum of 2,400\u20133,200 mg/day.\n\nA dose this high carries a serious risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily\n- Another dose\n\nIf 1600 mg four times daily is what you intend, tell me and I'll enter it with a note that you confirmed it. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and I'll enter it."
